    "body": "The all-games open failure came from the Home transition embedding every original cover at full size, then rejecting the combined snapshot above 2 MB. Transition covers are now bounded display thumbnails, and an oversized cosmetic snapshot now degrades without blocking the editor. The real hidden desktop host opened FF8, returned Home, resumed the same FF8 service, then opened RDR successfully. Restart Lexeditor once so the running desktop host loads this repair.",
